00:12:57,456 --> 00:13:03,696
Do you think we still need a stronger model, what do we need to see the impact of AI on our day-to-day positive impact?

140
00:13:04,256 --> 00:13:05,536
I think

141
00:13:06,816 --> 00:13:14,244
existing models are already very capable as a foundation upon which to build applications.

142
00:13:15,566 --> 00:13:17,924
There are so many things we can do

