151
00:13:37,230 --> 00:13:40,644
We spend almost one out of every five dollars on healthcare.

152
00:13:41,454 --> 00:13:43,136
And look at the outcomes.

153
00:13:43,296 --> 00:13:45,856
There are real public health challenges.

154
00:13:46,062 --> 00:13:48,576
There are real bottlenecks in the healthcare industry.

155
00:13:48,816 --> 00:13:58,212
Imagine nurses can be more involved in the care process, in diagnosis, prescription, decisions about patient well-being.

156
00:13:58,734 --> 00:14:01,092
And one big barrier for that is

157
