00:14:14,606 --> 00:14:21,936
Yeah, I think you probably need to train nurses a little differently. So there's a human capital aspect that's going to go complementary to that.

161
00:14:22,176 --> 00:14:28,336
But the bottleneck isn't the human capital of the nurses. The bottleneck is the application. The bottleneck is the tech industry not doing it.

162
00:14:28,496 --> 00:14:29,476
Teachers, same thing.

163
00:14:29,936 --> 00:14:30,736
Electricians.

