00:14:36,336 --> 00:14:41,376
Many blue-color tasks can be made much more effective with AI. We're seeing some of them in China.

166
00:14:41,536 --> 00:14:46,656
Again, why are we not doing that in the United States? So the bottleneck, isn't the foundation model.

167
00:14:46,816 --> 00:14:55,536
The bottleneck, I mean, even last year's models would have been good enough for most of the things that we could do. A lot of it sounds like a great business opportunity. It is.

