00:16:12,816 --> 00:16:16,548
AI that will make workers more productive, they say, this is exactly what we need.

184
00:16:17,134 --> 00:16:18,084
We're on board with it.

185
00:16:18,670 --> 00:16:19,296
Do they mean it?

186
00:16:19,502 --> 00:16:24,336
I don't know. I can't test because the tools are not being supplied by tech companies.

187
00:16:24,622 --> 00:16:34,736
When I mentioned the same thing to people from tech companies, they either nod and turn their head or they say, You live in a different world. We're going to create AGI. What are you talking about?

